| modifications.

| Conventions:
|   NAME should be the mfg. specification
|   ID numbers are in hex
|   IR_LENGTH values are in decimal
|   DR_LENGTH values are in <hex> for Instructions,
|	and <decimal> for Data length

| Texas Instruments 74ABT8245
{
  ID                        0
  NAME           TI_74ABT8245
  IR_LENGTH                 8
|              Instruction <hex>   Data Length <decimal>
  DR_LENGTH                FF            1      | FF is BYPASS
}

| Texas Instruments 74BCT8374
{
  ID                        0
  NAME           TI_74BCT8374
  IR_LENGTH                 8
|              Instruction <hex>   Data Length <decimal>
  DR_LENGTH                FF            1      | FF is BYPASS
  DR_LENGTH                02           18      | 02 is SAMPLE for this
}

| Texas Instruments 74BCT8373
{
  ID                        0
  NAME           TI_74BCT8373
  IR_LENGTH                 8
|              Instruction <hex>   Data Length <decimal>
  DR_LENGTH                FF            1
  DR_LENGTH                02           18      | 02 is SAMPLE for this
}

